{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17157","headline":"奉和圣制九日言怀赐中书门下及百寮 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制九日言怀赐中书门下及百寮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节在丰岁，皇情喜乂安。\n丝竹调六律，簪裾列千官。\n烟霜暮景清，水木秋光寒。\n筵开曲池上，望尽终南端。\n天文丽庆霄，墨妙惊飞鸾。\n愿言黄花酒，永奉今日欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}